cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Dual-Input Non-Isolated DC-DC Converter with Vehicle-to-Grid Feature"
type: software
abstract: "B.Tech project archive containing a MATLAB/Simulink model and documentation for a dual-input non-isolated DC-DC converter for solar PV/battery electric-vehicle applications with V2G/V2V and regenerative-energy features."
